cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "COSMOPOLITAN"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based application for uncertainty-aware spatial regionalization of sparse
  geodata. Random Forest regression with Monte Carlo uncertainty propagation turns point
  observations and predictor layers into continuous maps with associated uncertainty.
  Developed for, and used operationally in, soil moisture mapping from mobile cosmic-ray
  neutron sensing surveys. Part of the COSMO Suite and built on its reusable framework.
